<translation id="5406591571925937375">Yaqinda ochmagansiz. Freedom olib tashladi: <ph name="PERMISSION_1"/>, <ph name="PERMISSION_2"/>, <ph name="PERMISSION_3"/></translation>
<translation id="5174969993834422967">Odatda bildirishnomalarni bloklaysiz. Ularni olish uchun manzillar qatoridan yuqori oʻng burchakdagi bildirishnoma belgisini bosing.</translation>
